<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!-- Ode to Joy, the theme of the finale of Beethoven's Symphony No. 9 (1824; public domain), encoded by hand for Loomsong from the table in the build spec.
     16 written bars in D major, 4/4, quarter note = 116; bars 9 to 16 carry repeat signs, so one statement plays 24 bars. The last note of bar 12 is tied into bar 13:
     the last phrase arrives a beat early. divisions = 2 per quarter, so an eighth is 1, a quarter 2, a dotted quarter 3 and a half 4. Licence: MIT for this encoding; the melody is public domain. -->
